      "content": "idk if there's even anyone left to reach out to. everyone i used to know just... they all collectively decided i don't exist anymore. i go to the campus cafe and see them laughing and it's like i'm watching a movie of a life i'm not allowed to be part of. there's no \"navigating\" this, it's just a permanent wall. it feels like i'm already gone, you know?",
